  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "From ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/issues/2254"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When a STOMP message is published, spaces in the resource name are not escaped. For example, this header:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "org.fcrepo.jms.identifier:/test/City of God\n",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "And in the body:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "{\n  \"object\": {\n    \"id\": \"http://fedora.local.lan/rest/test/City of God\"\n  }\n}",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "My expectation is that it would be consistent with the subject of the triples:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl http://fedora.local.lan/rest/test/City%20of%20God\n@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\n@prefix fedora: <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#> .\n@prefix ldp: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#> .\n@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .\n\n<http://fedora.local.lan/rest/test/City%20of%20God>\n        dcterms:title          \"City of God\"@en-US ;\n        fedora:created         \"2025-08-30T02:09:18.688686832Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\n        fedora:lastModified    \"2025-08-30T23:38:47.971555291Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\n        fedora:createdBy       \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:BasicContainer ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:RDFSource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Container ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Container ;\n        fedora:hasParent       <http://fedora.local.lan/rest/test> .",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    }
   ],
