  "description": "<p>From <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/issues/2254\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/issues/2254</a> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>When a STOMP message is published, spaces in the resource name are not escaped. For example, this header:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>org.fcrepo.jms.identifier:/test/City of God\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>And in the body:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>{\n  \"object\": {\n    \"id\": \"http://fedora.local.lan/rest/test/City of God\"\n  }\n}</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>My expectation is that it would be consistent with the subject of the triples:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>curl http://fedora.local.lan/rest/test/City%20of%20God\n@prefix rdf: &lt;http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&gt; .\n@prefix fedora: &lt;http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#&gt; .\n@prefix ldp: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#&gt; .\n@prefix dcterms: &lt;http://purl.org/dc/terms/&gt; .\n\n&lt;http://fedora.local.lan/rest/test/City%20of%20God&gt;\n        dcterms:title          \"City of God\"@en-US ;\n        fedora:created         \"2025-08-30T02:09:18.688686832Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\n        fedora:lastModified    \"2025-08-30T23:38:47.971555291Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\n        fedora:createdBy       \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:BasicContainer ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:RDFSource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Container ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Container ;\n        fedora:hasParent       &lt;http://fedora.local.lan/rest/test&gt; .</pre>\n</div></div>",
